\itemize{
\item \code{skew}: Skewness, \code{m3 / m2^(3/2)}.
\item \code{kurtosis}: Pearson kurtosis, \code{m4 / m2^2}. A normal distribution has
kurtosis 3, not 0 (this is not excess kurtosis).
